// One Small Favour — sculpture Look/Search after Phantuwti 15→16.
// CANDIDATE last-resort 2007-base (OSRS Transcript:One Small Favour Petra).
// No dest / Petra spawn / Cromperty Talk-to / 12346. Hunt 289? no.
